                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Applicants will be considered for the position based upon, but not limited to, their length of Company service, relative training, experience, performance and conduct. When selecting applicants for interview, an individual possessing special skills, training, experience or education related to the job opening may receive special consideration.",
